  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **My Florida Sunshine**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Big Mon**: back after 149 archived shows (853 days) [2]\n- **Stone Walls And Steel Bars**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Down The Road**: back after 233 archived shows (1602 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Give The Fiddler A Dram**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Whistling Rufus**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Ragtime Anne**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Feast Here Tonight (Rabbit In A Log)**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-12.om1.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 157 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-12.om1.flac24**: taped by Archie Cove; transferred by Craig Taraszki; source: Line Audio OM1> Zoom F4 [1]. Also: Recorded with Line Audio om1 microphones in an AB pair at front-of-house, feeding a Zoom F4 recorder at 24-bit/48kHz; Edited in Audacity with a 40 Hz high-pass filter, gain envelope and normalization; tagged in Foobar2000 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Yuengling Center - Tampa, FL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/yuengling-center-tampa-fl-2/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Tampa Yuengling Center Night 1 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/tampa-yuengling-center-night-1-regular-poster/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Tampa Yuengling 2024 Run Swirl Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/tampa-yuengling-2024-run-glitter-foil/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Spring Tour 2024 Tour Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/spring-tour-2024-poster/) [6]",
